OL,3,APope discharged from hospital days
OL,4,Aafter lung cancer surgery
OL,5,
OL,6,FPope Leo XIV has been discharged from
OL,7,FRome's Gemelli Hospital, just four days
OL,8,Fafter an operation to remove a
OL,9,Fcancerous growth from his lung.
OL,11,FThe 71-year-old walked unaided to his
OL,12,Fwaiting car, stopping to speak to
OL,13,Fwell-wishers.
OL,15,FThe Vatican said the Pope will give the
OL,16,Ftraditional Angelus prayer and blessing
OL,17,Fto a crowd in St Peter's Square on
OL,18,FSunday, as he did last week when he
OL,19,Fsurprised the world by announcing the
OL,20,Fsurgery.
OL,23,APub: 17-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
