OL,3,APope discharged from hospital days
OL,4,Aafter lung cancer surgery
OL,5,
OL,6,FOn Friday, photographs were released of
OL,7,Fthe Pope celebrating Mass and
OL,8,Fdistributing communion in hospital for
OL,9,Fstaff.
